WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:08.900
Another highlight would have been the Tennessee game we lost in 1959, fourteen-thirteen to Tennessee.

2
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:14.140
Ran them all over the field and still they beat us in points.

3
00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:23.340
That was the controversial Billy Cannon two-point conversion that they say we didn’t get, which we still believe we got.

4
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.280
That would have been our nineteenth straight win,

5
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:33.880
and we probably would have gone undefeated throughout the rest of that year and been national champions two years in a row.

6
00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:37.440
The highlight of that game was not so much the game itself;

7
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:44.980
when we came back home there were ten thousand people who were waiting for us at the airport after we lost that game.

8
00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:49.840
That was one of the greatest thrills in my life.

9
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.500
People coming and wish you well after a big loss.

10
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.360
It’s hard to beat.
